</span> <span class=\"refpa\">317</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, les hommes ;\n<span class=\"ital\">avec un part.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὤν</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">πεφυκώς</span> : <span class=\"grec\">ἄνθρωπον ὄντα,\nἀνθρώπῳ πεφυκότι, ἀνθρώπους ὄντας,</span> étant né homme, étant\nhomme, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span> attendu qu’on est homme,\npuisqu’on est homme : <span class=\"grec\">πῶς οὐκ ἄνθρωπόν γε\nὄντα εἰκὸς σοφώτερον τούτων φαίνεσθαι;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 20,</span> comment ne serait-il pas naturel que l’homme\n(<span class=\"ital\">litt.</span> par cela même qu’il est homme) se\nmontrât plus intelligent que ces (bêtes) ? <span class=\"ital\">de\nmême,</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἀνθρώπῳ πεφυκότι,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 1, 3 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἀνθρώπους\nὄντας,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2,\n4, 5 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">κατ’ ἄνθρωπον,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Sept.</span> <span class=\"refch\">425 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.C.</span> <span class=\"refch\">598 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">DS.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 31,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">κατ’ ἀνθρώπους,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">DC.</span> <span class=\"refch\">53, 16,</span>\ncomme il convient à l’homme, comme il est habituel à l’homme, selon\nla nature humaine ; <span class=\"grec\">ὑπὲρ ἄνθρωπον,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">DC.</span> <span class=\"refch\">13, 21,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> au-dessus de l’homme, au-dessus des\nforces humaines ; <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> <span class=\"ital\">au plur. dans les loc.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐν\nἀνθρώποις, ἐξ ἀνθρώπων,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\nd’entre les hommes : <span class=\"grec\">δεινότατος τῶν ἐν\nἀνθρώποις,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1246, 13,</span> le meilleur homme du monde ; <span class=\"grec\">ὁ ἄριστος ἐν ἀνθρώποις ὄρτυξ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">211</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, la meilleure caille\ndu monde ; <span class=\"grec\">τὰ ἐξ ἀνθρώπων πράγματα,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Theæt.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">170</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, toutes\nles affaires du monde, <span class=\"ital\">c. à d.</span> tous les\nembarras possibles ; <span class=\"grec\">μάλιστα ἀνθρώπων,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 60,</span>\nplus que nul autre d’entre les hommes ; <span class=\"grec\">ἄριστά\nγ’ ἀνθρώπων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Theæt.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">148</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, le mieux du monde ; <span class=\"grec\">ἥκιστα\nἀνθρώπων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">361</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">67</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, pas le moins du\nmonde ; <span class=\"ital\">joint à un subst.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἄνθρ. ὁδίτης,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">16, 263,</span> un voyageur ; <span class=\"grec\">ἄνθρ. βασιλεύς,</span> <span class=\"aut\">NT.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Matth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">22, 2,</span>\nun roi ; <span class=\"ital\">ou à un n. de peuple :</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πόλις Μερόπων ἀνθρώπων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hh.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ap.</span> <span class=\"refch\">42,</span> la ville des Méropes ; <span class=\"ital\">mais,\nainsi construit, souv. avec un sens de mépris chez les\nAtt. :</span> 